      "id": "ann_1",
      "title": "Emergency Road Closure & Structural Concrete Reinforcement on Central Flyover",
      "subtitle": "Traffic Diversion active along Ring Road 2 between Metro Junction and Gate 4",
      "content": "The Municipal Roads & Infrastructure Department hereby issues an urgent notice regarding the mandatory structural reinforcement of the Central Promenade Flyover. \n\nField inspections detected minor asphalt expansion joints requiring high-grade epoxy grout and load-bearing concrete dampening.\n\n### Operational Details:\n• **Closure Duration:** Saturday, July 25th, 10:00 PM to Sunday, July 26th, 06:00 AM.\n• **Affected Stretch:** Central Promenade Flyover (Both Northbound & Southbound lanes).\n• **Traffic Diversions:** Heavy commercial vehicles diverted via Ring Road 2. Passenger vehicles routed through Heritage Square Avenue.\n• **On-Site Safety:** Municipal Traffic Police officers will be deployed at key choke points with LED signage.\n\nCitizens are advised to plan transit accordingly. Emergency response vehicles (ambulances & fire tenders) will retain priority lane access under escort.",
