    {
      "id": "ann_2",
      "title": "Scheduled Hydro Flushing & Pipeline Upgrade in Wards 1 & 2",
      "subtitle": "Water pressure reduction expected during high-pressure feeder sanitation",
      "content": "Smart City Water Supply Authority will conduct bi-annual high-pressure feeder line flushing and automatic flow sensor calibration across Ward 1 (Metro North) and Ward 2 (Civic Tech Hub).\n\n### Impact & Timelines:\n• **Date & Time:** Thursday, July 24th, 06:00 AM – 12:00 PM (6 Hours).\n• **Expected Impact:** Temporary low water pressure in residential high-rises and commercial complexes.\n• **Advisory:** Citizens are encouraged to store adequate drinking water in advance. Free municipal water tankers will be stationed at Metro North Park and Tech Hub Sector 3.",
      "category": "Water Supply",
      "priority": "High",
      "department": "Water Supply & Sewage",
      "bannerImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584467735871-8e85353a8413?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "att_3",
