      "title": "Special Monsoon Waste & E-Waste Door-to-Door Drive Launched",
      "subtitle": "Free municipal pickup for heavy appliances, yard timber, and electronic scrap",
      "content": "In preparation for peak monsoon runoff, the Municipal Solid Waste Management Division has launched a citywide drive for heavy bulk waste clearance.\n\nCitizens can request direct doorstep pickup for broken furniture, electronic debris, discarded batteries, and overgrown tree trimmings via the CivicPulse Mobile Portal.\n\n### Guidelines:\n1. Place segregated electronic waste in yellow biodegradable bags.\n2. Schedule pickup slots through the \"Report Issue -> Sanitation\" button on CivicPulse.\n3. Hazardous chemicals or industrial solvent drums are strictly prohibited.",
