      "subtitle": "Brief nighttime power outages scheduled on Waterfront Promenade Esplanade",
      "content": "The Urban Electrical & Streetlighting Department is converting 1,200 traditional high-sodium streetlights to IoT-connected smart adaptive LEDs along Ward 5 Waterfront East.\n\n### Maintenance Window:\n• **Date:** Friday, July 25th, 01:00 AM to 04:00 AM (3 Hours).\n• **Scope:** Luminaire sensor replacement and high-voltage transformer maintenance.\n• **Safety Note:** Standby diesel generators will power public safety CCTV cameras and pedestrian walkways throughout the operation.",
