      "title": "Monsoon Heavy Rainfall & Flash Flood Readiness Advisory",
      "subtitle": "Municipal Emergency Control Room established with 24/7 dewatering pumps",
      "content": "The Regional Meteorological Department forecasts heavy monsoon precipitation exceeding 120mm over the next 48 hours.\n\nThe Municipal Corporation has activated the **Disaster Emergency Command Center**. \n\n### Citizen Directives:\n• Avoid low-lying underpasses along Industrial Sector 4.\n• Report clogged storm grates immediately using the **CivicPulse Emergency Button**.\n• Emergency Dewatering Pumps have been pre-positioned at 14 flood-prone intersections.\n• Emergency Control Hotline: **112** or **1800-233-CIVIC**.",
